This is the common library directory.  For a description of the library,
see common.tex.

Makefile
README.nodes
README.short_list
common.tex

common.h		library header file
config.c		template library config file.  this is needed
			for every node.
control.c		control process.  should be called as last thing
			in main().
debug.c			debugging support routines.
header.h		a description of the message format
mem.c			memory allocation routines.  these allocate from
			a fixed pool of memory.
message.c		stubs.
monitor.c		not used.  never tested.
proc.c			downloadable process support.
protocol.h		declarations for the message protocol.
queue.c			queue routines.
shared.h		shared memory file.  included in a few places
			for devious (but necessary) debugging on the b016.
talk.c			reader/writer/router.  this is the message passing
			module.
var.c			this handles set/read vars messages.
var_sr.c		the standard set/read var routines.
